<item>
<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-01T21:18:42.489Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 21:18:42 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen attacked a military checkpoint in Plateau, killing a soldier and stealing two weapons, and later wounded a soldier with a machete while injuring two civilians with gunfire in a community raid. In Borno, troops killed ISWAP leaders and a shura council member, repelling an attack and preventing further assaults. Police rescued 11 abducted women and farmers across six states and arrested suspects, while a dozen children were kidnapped in central Nigeria. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxNdXVib1JfRjZjSzVhZHdDQU9WNGItdk5kd2s3REFyN21jZ0NaNDBBcWE1NFJtQ3hzTXAwQ21KRk5xc1k5R3VYdmZ1U2pGMnJQRmE5a0N5Njl4YUpEazM5c0lMTUo3UHlKLVB4UDNvSDd0WHR5RFltMEs3R2MtUVdKVw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNZUNxRHNEODllZ3Ntc1AyaGtleVc2RjNEcFlFbERtbkFnX3JoWld5eHZTYkV1NkI3LXNQZndhWTRQRnVVSjBsYnFjc3dXUDlHZ1E1R2VOR0RUcEJJa3VHOUdON1ZESlpOUUR1NzdWRGtPUW1SejFBSHBiQXcxY2Y1Wks3bFM4QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Peoples Gazette Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE1SMmJOR0ppamg3R3otSXdaTUt5TDBBLWRBZW9yTlpCTmV2bVo5aVZTQnZ4VjZJRjc3ZDh3T0FsekxzZmZlNGhVWi10ZU1IeWdyemVDdzZ0N2pqMFBLcmY1VU9Rc01FVEcxZzZLZWVLemFEaVZsbkFSUg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Punch Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE1jQ3dUR1EzNzZ5VHBVSG9TMVJ1bklQMzFQLU1yQWNsWlN6VkRIRFUzaDhEVGRucGxncW1VUnExdnp4S1pfVjVfTkdfWUg5Q0k?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة سبأ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxPS1pMVG9vMUNqdG1RMklpTjRsanlfVGtXT3phM2xFV3FwSG4xVFY0bjd5aEJzc2xvSl9sUlV6d3RRand6VE94RXlBSV9VSGV5bS1xcVVBZlRVcFgzeFZsaC1xNjV0cjFGekZJTUE1UWZ0LXZ5NFlObWxFZm0tR0JWRGN6dDNOcHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Th